      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're recognizing the limitations of solely prioritizing predictivity. By adopting a fairness under uncertainty framework, you're not only improving ESG, but also aligning your company with the values of a modern, socially conscious industry. This approach also acknowledges that AI systems are only as good as the data and context they're trained on, and that addressing disparities can ultimately lead to better long-term outcomes. I'd say you're on the right track by prioritizing a more comprehensive and ethical approach to AI development.",
      "source": "target",
